@Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5242

### 1. Place a new order (Pure internal placement, 0 gateway coupling)
# @name createOrder
POST {{Api_HostAddress}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 149.99
}

### 2. Fetch order details (Status: Pending)
@orderId = {{createOrder.response.body.id}}
GET {{Api_HostAddress}}/api/orders/{{orderId}}
Accept: application/json

### 3. Create Payment Intent (Client starts checkout, gets clientSecret)
# @name createIntent
POST {{Api_HostAddress}}/api/orders/{{orderId}}/pay
Content-Type: application/json

### 4. Admin / Manual Mark as Paid (Simulate completed payment)
POST {{Api_HostAddress}}/api/orders/{{orderId}}/mark-paid
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "gatewayTransactionId": "sim_tx_12345"
}

### 5. Fetch order details after Payment (Status: Completed)
GET {{Api_HostAddress}}/api/orders/{{orderId}}
Accept: application/json

### 6. List all orders with payment history
GET {{Api_HostAddress}}/api/orders
Accept: application/json
